  "steps": [
    "Rinse the rice, then cook it according to the packet instructions until fluffy. Keep it covered while you finish the stir-fry.",
    "Mix the tamari, water, cornstarch and sugar in a small bowl until smooth.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large wok or frying pan over high heat. Add the prawns and stir-fry for 2 to 3 minutes until pink and just cooked through. Remove to a plate.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger to the pan and stir-fry for 20 seconds until fragrant, then add the broccoli, carrot and red pepper. Cook for 3 to 4 minutes, stirring often, until the vegetables are bright and crisp-tender.",
    "Return the prawns to the pan, pour in the sauce and toss for 1 to 2 minutes until glossy and lightly thickened. Stir through the spring onions, sesame oil, salt and white pepper.",
    "Serve the stir-fry hot over the rice."
